{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14417","headline":"边城曲 · 戴叔伦","name":"边城曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人生莫作远行客，远行莫戍黄沙碛。\n黄沙碛下八月时，霜风裂肤百草衰。\n尘沙晴天迷道路，河水悠悠向东去。\n胡笳听彻双泪流，羁魂惨惨生边愁。\n原头猎火夜相向，马蹄蹴蹋层冰上。\n不似京华侠少年，清歌妙舞落花前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}